Not every file in this repository is wholly original work. Some files are
ports, forks, or adaptations of other authors' publicly available scripts
or open-source projects, carried over and modified for use in this suite.
Known examples include:

  - SneakyKeel_v0_1_0.cs -- derived from the "Sentinel Suite" project,
    originally licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, Copyright (c)
    2026 silentsudo-io and the Sentinel Suite contributors. That file
    remains subject to the terms of the MPL 2.0 (see
    https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/) to the extent it incorporates that
    original source; the all-rights-reserved terms above apply only to this
    repository's own modifications and additions to it.
  - SneakyIctMarketStructure.cs -- adapted from a TradingView Pine Script
    indicator, "ICT Market Structure Screener," by the TradingView author
    Zeiierman.
  - SneakyBuyersSellersProfile.cs -- adapted from the TradingView Pine
    Script indicator "Buyers & Sellers Profile + Dynamic S/R," by Zeiierman.
  - SneakyRsiStrengthZones.cs -- adapted from the TradingView Pine Script
    indicator "RSI Strength & Consolidation Zones," by Zeiierman.
  - SneakySuperTrendCluster.cs -- adapted from the TradingView Pine Script
    indicator "SuperTrend Cluster," by Zeiierman.

Other files in this repository may likewise incorporate logic ported or
